# Neutrality gate for the tripled time price on squad_range_control (night watch
# 2026-08-22 -> 23). squad_range_control_timecost_v1_seed14 passed all four
# pre-registered clauses at the seed that CAPTURES; these two ask the other
# half of the question — does the price damage a seed that never needed it?
# Baselines are the same seeds at the default price: squad_range_control_v1_seed12
# (N=100 0.920) and _seed15 (N=100 0.940). Sequential, not parallel: one box.
squad_range_control_timecost_v1_seed15 --scenario squad_range_control --total-steps 3000000 --seed 15 --reward time_penalty=-0.03
squad_range_control_timecost_v1_seed12 --scenario squad_range_control --total-steps 3000000 --seed 12 --reward time_penalty=-0.03
